New native OpenATV layouts, generator and settings plugin: GPL-2.0-or-later.

Adapted embedded OpenATV Enigma2 XML screen definitions retain their original
authorship and licensing. See the OpenATV source headers and LICENSES/GPL-2.0-or-later.txt
for their terms. No Enigma2 receiver Python implementation is copied.

Umbra uses Liberation Sans supplied by OpenATV and includes one shared
enigma2icons font with additional menu and broadcast-status glyphs. Existing glyphs and
codepoints are preserved. Google Material Symbols are Apache-2.0; see the
enigma2iconfont source list and licenses. No per-resolution font copies.

The broadcast status variants include Dolby and HbbTV trademark shapes.
They are not Google Material assets and no trademark license is granted.
HbbTV monochrome outline provenance and logo guidelines:
https://www.hbbtv.org/logo-access/
https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/de/3/32/HbbTVLogo.svg
The shared icon font is maintained in the OpenATV enigma2iconfont project.

MetrixHD screen adaptations, the shared MetrixIcons weather font and PNG assets retain the source authorship: iMaxxx and the
OpenATV Team. Original terms: "Explicitly, no one is allowed to use any
version of the Skin with other team Images" and "You can modify and
redistribute it as long as you keep this license and the original author
for the skin and all of your modifications". These adaptations are for
OpenATV only. Bundled assets include the weather icon font, MediaPlayer repeat indicators and small plugin
images. They are reused without per-resolution duplicates. No third-party
plugin Python implementation is included or modified.
